    <section class="overview flexC flexM" id="overview">

        <div class="section-desc fullW flexC"><h2>What is actiTIME?</h2>
<p>ActiTime is a powerful time-monitoring software that uses intelligent data to help organizations evaluate performance levels on the move. Businesses may use the program to establish project-specific scopes and allocate them to various teams so everyone is on the same page. In addition, users may manually record work hours or utilize the built-in timer to meet their needs.</p>
<p>Moreover, actiTIME provides a variety of invoicing and job management functions, although it&#8217;s primarily a time-tracking application. For example, teams may log the time spent on certain projects and leave comments for supervisors to read about their job daily. This tool also aids in the tracking of overtime, vacation time, leaves, and sick days for additional monitoring of an individual or team&#8217;s performance.</p>
</div>

        
    </section>

    
        
